        { term: 'Just Transition', definition: 'Ensuring that the shift from fossil fuels to clean energy doesn\'t leave workers and communities behind. Requires retraining, community investment, and social support.', example: 'Germany\'s "coal exit" includes €40 billion for coal regions over 20 years, retraining workers, attracting new industries, and supporting communities.' }
